101
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:43,480
Number 11 points to the top arch of the headset.

102
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:49,320
Looking at our option box, band is option C, so the correct answer is C.

103
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:50,580
Question 12.

104
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:56,440
Next, the speaker describes the circular parts and mentions a soft, round pad.

105
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:59,820
Number 12 points to the cushioned area on the ear cup.

106
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:02,660
This matches option F, ear pads.

107
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:05,680
Therefore, the answer for 12 is F.

108
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,880
Question 13.

109
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:12,720
The speaker describes a long, flexible arm with a microphone at the end.

110
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:16,280
Number 13 points directly to this microphone boom.

111
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:21,200
Checking our list, microphone is option E, so the answer is E.

112
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:23,560
Question 14.

113
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:27,520
The speaker mentions a cable used to connect to devices.

114
00:07:27,900 --> 00:07:31,720
Number 14 points to the wire extending from the headset.

115
00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:34,580
In the box, cable is option A.

116
00:07:34,820 --> 00:07:36,560
The correct letter is A.

117
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,320
Question 15.

118
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:43,400
We are told to look for a small plastic box on the cable called the

119
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:43,900
switch.

120
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:47,060
Number 15 points clearly to this control box.

121
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:49,760
This corresponds to option D, switch.

122
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,520
The answer is D.

123
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,260
Question 16.

124
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:57,980
Finally, the speaker points out the metal tip at the end of the cord, calling

125
00:07:57,980 --> 00:07:58,780
it the plug.

126
00:07:58,940 --> 00:08:01,320
Number 16 points to the connector jack.

127
00:08:01,420 --> 00:08:03,420
This matches option B, plug.

128
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:05,220
So the final answer is B.

